# Release notes are local drafting files: they are not shipped in the npm
# package (see the `files` field) and every release's notes are generated into
# the GitHub Release by .github/workflows/release.yml, so the repository does
# not carry them. docs/design.md stays tracked — it ships with the package.
docs/release-notes-*.md
